Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.10,0:00:05.16,Default,,0,0,0,,As we all travel across the\Nsea Raising our voices We
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.24,0:00:09.58,Default,,0,0,0,,take in the beautiful blue\Nworld Our spirits ready to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.66,0:00:13.38,Default,,0,0,0,,go Everybody rejoices Now\Nlet's go get the sails all
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.24,0:00:26.02,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah Here we are in between\Nthe sea and the sky Ready
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.10,0:00:30.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Now for adventure. We're\Nitching to try. Get ready to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.10,0:00:36.02,Default,,0,0,0,,roam So all aboard now We're\Nset to go Set sail to the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.10,0:00:41.26,Default,,0,0,0,,ocean so deep Ready for a\Ntruly grand adventure Well,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.34,0:00:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,don't you think That sounds really\Nfun All this excitement Second to
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.66,0:00:52.56,Default,,0,0,0,,none As we all travel across the sea\NRaising our voices We take in the
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.64,0:00:58.44,Default,,0,0,0,,beautiful blue world Our spirits ready\Nto go Everybody rejoices Now let's
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.52,0:01:02.34,Default,,0,0,0,,go get the sales all unfurled La la
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.64,0:01:10.70,Default,,0,0,0,,yeah If there's something\Nthat I just won't
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.78,0:01:13.70,Default,,0,0,0,,ever forget. It's the way that I felt when
Dialogue: 0,0:01:13.78,0:01:17.40,Default,,0,0,0,,our journey was set Now\NI won't be scared As
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.48,0:01:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,long as I keep that\Nfeeling there With that,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.94,0:01:26.32,Default,,0,0,0,,let us keep up the pace While\Nenjoying every trip from place to
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.40,0:01:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,place Our timid hearts get the\Nrhythm ingrained So let's keep going,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.36,0:01:37.58,Default,,0,0,0,,adventure awaits So many treasures\Nawait So now let's raise our voices
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.66,0:01:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,in pride Laughing out when they are\Nfound With all the riches in hand,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.62,0:01:46.86,Default,,0,0,0,,everybody rejoices Party on,\Ncause we stand tall and proud
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.68,0:01:52.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Life is adventurous. Be aware it's\Ndangerous. Who's gonna be one of us?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.20,0:01:54.42,Default,,0,0,0,,And a trip goes on because.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.50,0:01:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the pirates of the mouse.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.26,0:01:57.88,Default,,0,0,0,,To the west, to the east.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.96,0:02:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Gotta find my way, sail away,\Nall the way to one piece.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.76,0:02:03.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring all your dreams with\Nyou now, fill the void.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.26,0:02:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,In your heart, spread your wings.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.92,0:02:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,And believe that you can soar.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.14,0:02:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let the breeze guide the way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.04,0:02:11.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Till you're ready to start up once again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.58,0:02:13.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now you're ready for more.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.28,0:02:15.52,Default,,0,0,0,,So many treasures away.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.60,0:02:18.06,Default,,0,0,0,,So now let's raise our voices in pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.14,0:02:20.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Laughing out when they are found.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:20.44,0:02:22.22,Default,,0,0,0,,With all the riches in hand.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.30,0:02:24.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Everybody rejoices, party on.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.82,0:02:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Cause we stand tall and proud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.84,0:02:32.48,Default,,0,0,0,,She's so brutal.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.76,0:02:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,It's like she's some kind of\Ncrazy fire redeeming woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.92,0:02:39.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And I know we said way too much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.32,0:02:41.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't forget, Mistress\NPerona loves treasure too.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.98,0:02:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, she'll never\Ntake it away from her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.58,0:02:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, I wish we hadn't\Ntold her about the shortcut.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.34,0:02:48.76,Default,,0,0,0,,We messed up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.86,0:02:52.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That cheeky little brat.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.52,0:02:54.46,Default,,0,0,0,,How dare she try to take my treasure?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.54,0:02:58.84,Default,,0,0,0,,And she wants to steal the Sunny, load\Nit up, and use it as her getaway boat?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.92,0:03:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Sorry, sweetie, you don't\Nknow who you're messing with!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.74,0:03:06.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to hurry and\Nget back to the Sunny!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.98,0:03:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on, what's up with this weird bridge?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.88,0:03:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,It doesn't look like\Neverything else around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.08,0:03:15.37,Default,,0,0,0,,It's narrow, but it's really well made.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.38,0:03:20.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Stupid bastards!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.04,0:03:21.87,Default,,0,0,0,,That's it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:22.00,0:03:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,No one ate it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.54,0:03:25.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Holy crap!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.24,0:03:29.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't see anything!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.30,0:03:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, now you've done it!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.72,0:03:37.80,Default,,0,0,0,,When I get up, I'm gonna stop\Nyou Pipsqueak parents flat!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.06,0:03:40.82,Default,,0,0,0,,There won't even be more flat to bury!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.82,0:03:49.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh crap, this guy is seriously\Npissed off! This is bad! Really bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.36,0:03:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Here he comes!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.52,0:03:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.74,0:03:55.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Dammit, I can't move!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:55.86,0:03:58.16,Default,,0,0,0,,My eyes are stuck on the ground!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.32,0:03:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,This sucks!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.36,0:04:09.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, you're stuck, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.80,0:04:32.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe he always just likes\Nscreaming when he's kicking ass.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.92,0:04:36.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I mean, come on, it's not like he\Ncould actually be losing, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.34,0:04:39.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Cut it out!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.94,0:04:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Retreat! All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.46,0:04:50.74,Default,,0,0,0,,These guys are like little demons.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.34,0:04:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess that wasn't enough to keep him\Ndown from what I've seen even though He's
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.30,0:04:59.12,Default,,0,0,0,,big and red and all this guy still has\Ntraces of Luffy's personality left in it?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.20,0:05:00.20,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.28,0:05:04.72,Default,,0,0,0,,He already told us he didn't recognize any\Nof us and that Moria was his master Yeah,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.80,0:05:05.66,Default,,0,0,0,,but even so
Dialogue: 0,0:05:06.40,0:05:07.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Check it out! Look!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.96,0:05:09.44,Default,,0,0,0,,There's a huge hunk of meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.52,0:05:10.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Hunk of meat?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.64,0:05:14.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Necroze!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.80,0:05:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,He's halfway down. Cut it as three.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.88,0:05:24.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if there were rules, I don't\Nthink this guy would follow him.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.48,0:05:25.31,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:25.39,0:05:27.70,Default,,0,0,0,,He's down again after\Na blow to the kneecaps!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.48,0:05:29.31,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.76,0:05:31.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Keep it up, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.82,0:05:36.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Just stall him till the captain\Nbeats the crap out of Merde!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.16,0:05:38.93,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry up and get those\Nshadows back, Straw Hat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.78,0:05:42.18,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no reason to keep\Nscrewing around like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.26,0:05:43.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's put him down for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.60,0:05:46.43,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.51,0:05:48.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought the idea was for\Nus to keep this big monster
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.72,0:05:51.22,Default,,0,0,0,,busy to make sure he doesn't\Nget in Straw Hat's way!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.30,0:05:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no way we can\Nbeat this thing, man!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.38,0:05:55.14,Default,,0,0,0,,There wasn't any meat!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.58,0:05:56.54,Default,,0,0,0,,You tricked me!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.62,0:05:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,I built my kneecaps!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.36,0:06:00.84,Default,,0,0,0,,A fight isn't truly over until you've won!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.00,0:06:02.88,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not just a giant, he's a zombie!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.96,0:06:04.76,Default,,0,0,0,,To beat him, you're\Ngonna have to purify him!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.84,0:06:05.84,Default,,0,0,0,,That's right, Zoro!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.92,0:06:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,We're just buying time!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:07.14,0:06:07.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Take it easy!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.05,0:06:09.35,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't want to help, stand back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:09.44,0:06:12.85,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't feel like waiting\Naround for Luffy to win, either.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.52,0:06:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,A dinosaur could step on this blade\Nand it wouldn't bend a millimeter.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.38,0:06:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They say that hardness is the greatest\Ncharacteristic of a black blade.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.90,0:06:32.14,Default,,0,0,0,,With Chouchou here, I've finally\Ngotten my hands on a first-rate sword.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.48,0:06:36.28,Default,,0,0,0,,And I think this is a perfect\Ntime to try it out. Stop it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.54,0:06:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Why you gotta be so stubborn?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.92,0:06:39.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Just let Lock beat Moria!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.30,0:06:44.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.08,0:06:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is that? What does she want?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.98,0:06:51.36,Default,,0,0,0,,It's that pirate woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.64,0:06:56.18,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you think you're doing with\Nall that treasure I was gonna steal?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.26,0:06:58.73,Default,,0,0,0,,And what are you doing on board the Sunny?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.10,0:07:04.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I was worried there for a\Nsecond, but it's only you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.40,0:07:07.68,Default,,0,0,0,,How'd the wedding ceremony\Nwith Absalom go over already?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.76,0:07:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, give me a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.92,0:07:11.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Who would ever want to marry\Nthat invisible pervert beast man?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.74,0:07:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And I take it you managed\Nto escape the wedding.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.32,0:07:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Absalom can't do anything right.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.16,0:07:18.82,Default,,0,0,0,,So, what are you gonna do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.26,0:07:23.08,Default,,0,0,0,,As you surmised, I do plan on stealing\Nyour ship to escape from Thriller Bark,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.16,0:07:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,and I'm bringing all the treasure with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.66,0:07:27.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If you try to stop me, I'll fight you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.04,0:07:29.50,Default,,0,0,0,,And you won't like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.34,0:07:35.60,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not very strong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.68,0:07:38.92,Default,,0,0,0,,so the mini-hollow ghost army will\Nbe more than sufficient against you.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.00,0:07:40.96,Default,,0,0,0,,The only one among you that put up a fight
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.04,0:07:43.69,Default,,0,0,0,,against me was that\Ndepressing long-nosed guy
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.88,0:07:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Who is that
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.02,0:07:59.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Just who in the hell are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.70,0:08:02.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't know him,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.74,0:08:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,but he's definitely an enemy\Njust now He made some of our
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.60,0:08:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,brothers vanish without a trace\Nright before our very eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.64,0:08:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He's the ordinary man.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.28,0:08:13.00,Default,,0,0,0,,He's dangerous. Whoever\Nhe is, he's bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.38,0:08:15.21,Default,,0,0,0,,Vanished?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.62,0:08:20.20,Default,,0,0,0,,It can't be. I think. I think.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.28,0:08:21.66,Default,,0,0,0,,I know who this man is.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.04,0:08:29.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.00,0:08:34.46,Default,,0,0,0,,One of the seven warlords of the sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.82,0:08:37.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The tyrant, Bartholomew Kuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.98,0:08:42.04,Default,,0,0,0,,The atrocities he committed when he\Nwas a pirate are beyond the pale.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.24,0:08:47.58,Default,,0,0,0,,One of the seven warlords on the sea?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:51.08,0:08:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What's a guy like him doing\Nhere on Thriller Bark?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.14,0:08:55.61,Default,,0,0,0,,You've got to be kidding.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.02,0:09:04.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you work for Moria? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.68,0:09:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Master Moria?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.00,0:09:07.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I was, but I'm not anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.86,0:09:09.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I've had enough of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.74,0:09:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm just trying to\Nescape from this island.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.66,0:09:14.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I want no part of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.96,0:09:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,If you could take a vacation,\Nwhere is it you'd like to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.12,0:09:22.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He's making small talk.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:23.48,0:09:26.30,Default,,0,0,0,,This is not the time or\Nplace for such nonsense.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.06,0:09:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I were to go on a vacation,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.66,0:09:35.20,Default,,0,0,0,,somewhere dark and damp, Somewhere\Nwith an old, creepy castle.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.52,0:09:38.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd spend every day there\Nsinging a song of curses.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.36,0:09:39.19,Default,,0,0,0,,She answered!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.94,0:09:41.54,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the ghost princess for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:41.62,0:09:42.45,Default,,0,0,0,,I agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.53,0:09:44.53,Default,,0,0,0,,We loved your answer, Mistress Verona.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.64,0:09:46.58,Default,,0,0,0,,I got caught up in my daydream.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.40,0:09:48.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop screwing around.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:49.36,0:09:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,I admit I was taken aback\Nwhen I realized who you were.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.74,0:09:54.78,Default,,0,0,0,,But I've got nothing to fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.08,0:10:00.02,Default,,0,0,0,,With my Devil Fruit powers, there's no one\NI can't take down, and that includes you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.30,0:10:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you listening to me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.00,0:10:08.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I'd imagine your shadow is\Npretty strong, isn't it, Kuma?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.22,0:10:09.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Good.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.13,0:10:12.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Then I'll take it from you as a\Nparting gift to my former master Moria.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.38,0:10:13.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So prepare yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.98,0:10:16.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Negative ghost!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:17.82,0:10:19.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And special hollow!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.78,0:10:21.90,Default,,0,0,0,,All right!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.14,0:10:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,There it is!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.34,0:10:25.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Mistress Perona's ultimate combo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:34.34,0:10:36.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Before you interrupted\Nwith all that yelling,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.22,0:10:40.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I was simply going to\Nask you where Moria is.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.74,0:10:44.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Where did she go?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.10,0:10:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Mrs. Perona!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.78,0:10:50.34,Default,,0,0,0,,What was that? I'm scared!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.26,0:10:52.09,Default,,0,0,0,,She disappeared!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:52.17,0:10:53.00,Default,,0,0,0,,What about you?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.09,0:10:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do with Mrs.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.22,0:10:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Perona, you bastard?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.92,0:10:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,Unforgivable!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.96,0:10:58.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Where's our princess?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.66,0:10:59.84,Default,,0,0,0,,You're gonna pay!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.88,0:11:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,You're the cat burglar, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:24.20,0:11:26.26,Default,,0,0,0,,One of the Straw Hat Pirates.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.28,0:11:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I've heard that Monkey D.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.94,0:11:30.53,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy has an older brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.76,0:11:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that true?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.20,0:11:37.16,Default,,0,0,0,,No way!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.54,0:11:39.26,Default,,0,0,0,,He just suddenly appeared up there.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.34,0:11:40.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Did he teleport?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:41.22,0:11:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, he does.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.94,0:11:44.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You're talking about Ace, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:44.74,0:11:46.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Why do you want to know?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.32,0:11:48.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.60,0:11:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So the rumors are true.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.90,0:11:51.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, so?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.81,0:11:52.93,Default,,0,0,0,,What's all this about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.02,0:11:54.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What do you want?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.26,0:11:55.73,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you really a warlord?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.04,0:12:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What I'm doing here is\Nnone of your concern.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:04.16,0:12:06.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That guy is bad news.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:06.22,0:12:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,What does he want with Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:08.02,0:12:10.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got to go warn him.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.40,0:12:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Got you Maria.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:15.92,0:12:17.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You're mine.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.52,0:12:22.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not getting away.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:22.28,0:12:23.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This time you bastard.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.72,0:12:26.24,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna beat the crap out of you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.32,0:12:28.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Give everyone shadows back.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:28.12,0:12:30.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Now gong gong.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.86,0:12:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:41.02,0:12:42.40,Default,,0,0,0,,He tricked me!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.68,0:12:45.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, hold on!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.80,0:12:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't ignore me, you dumb shadow!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.88,0:12:49.14,Default,,0,0,0,,No, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.50,0:12:52.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Or at least tell me where the hell I am!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.52,0:12:54.35,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:59.66,0:13:03.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh man, this sucks.\NEverybody's counting on me to.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:03.22,0:13:05.44,Default,,0,0,0,,beat moria and get their\Nshadows back for them?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.52,0:13:11.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And I gotta do it by sunrise wait why\Ndo we need our shadows back by then?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.98,0:13:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh yeah the sun's gonna\Nmelt us we're gonna be
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.76,0:13:21.41,Default,,0,0,0,,dust if I can't work\Nthis out before morning!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.52,0:13:22.64,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:22.98,0:13:24.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been gone too long already!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.40,0:13:40.08,Default,,0,0,0,,You want a real fight?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.28,0:13:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like you found one!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.08,0:13:43.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's see what you got!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.02,0:13:58.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Didn't notice it earlier, but Shusui's got\Na lot more heft to it than my Yubashiri.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.42,0:14:00.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Never used a black blade before.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.50,0:14:02.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Zoro, get out of the way!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.94,0:14:04.88,Default,,0,0,0,,But with this weight...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.06,0:14:08.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.36,0:14:11.60,Default,,0,0,0,,He deflected the punch with the sword!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.02,0:14:13.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Three-sword style!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.52,0:14:16.32,Default,,0,0,0,,108 caliber phoenix!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.70,0:14:19.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It's enormous!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.50,0:14:24.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You're stronger than I expected.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.42,0:14:28.19,Default,,0,0,0,,The blade absorbed the slashes\Nof the other two swords into one.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.34,0:14:32.12,Default,,0,0,0,,It's impressive, but it still moves\Na little too slow for my liking.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.20,0:14:36.32,Default,,0,0,0,,That just means I've got some work\Nto do before I can fully master it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.74,0:14:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,The increase in power\Nsure is nice, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.36,0:14:42.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's just hope I live long\Nenough to bring it under control.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.60,0:14:46.48,Default,,0,0,0,,You gave me one hell of\Na sword, Samurai Ryuma.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.24,0:14:51.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You little guys are fast!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.46,0:14:53.64,Default,,0,0,0,,You could have put out my eye with that!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.72,0:14:55.50,Default,,0,0,0,,You runny bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.06,0:15:00.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm gonna grind you down to go!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.90,0:15:05.42,Default,,0,0,0,,You can't spend the\Nentire fight dodging him!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.50,0:15:06.97,Default,,0,0,0,,Why'd he gotta be so big?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:15.58,0:15:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That was close.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.66,0:15:19.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is he?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.02,0:15:22.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't see with all the dust.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.88,0:15:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Three-sword style.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.30,0:15:26.92,Default,,0,0,0,,108-caliber Phoenix!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:28.38,0:15:30.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Come on, Zoro. Don't push it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.54,0:15:31.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're just making things worse.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.00,0:15:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Even if you do somehow miraculously\Ntake him down, what's the point?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.96,0:15:37.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Luffy shadow's the only one\Nwe'll get back from him.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.86,0:15:40.26,Default,,0,0,0,,We don't even have the\Nslightest idea where yours and
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.34,0:15:43.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Sanji's are If we really\Nwant to get our shadows back,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.22,0:15:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,we just need to wait here\Nuntil Luffy takes care of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.98,0:15:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,There's no point in killing yourself\Ntrying to take down an undead giant.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.50,0:15:53.36,Default,,0,0,0,,All we got to do is believe in Luffy and\Ntry to keep this guy busy for a while.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.44,0:15:59.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I've got plenty of faith in Luffy, but I'm\Nalso aware of Luffy's one major weakness.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.04,0:16:00.92,Default,,0,0,0,,It's trickery.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.46,0:16:06.70,Default,,0,0,0,,They've got an invisible man, a girl who\Ncontrols ghosts, and a Shadow Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.30,0:16:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Trickery is the name of\Nthe game on this island,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:09.38,0:16:11.32,Default,,0,0,0,,and they're all professionals at it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:11.40,0:16:15.68,Default,,0,0,0,,It's safe to say that none of them is\Nplanning on giving Luffy a fair fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:15.76,0:16:17.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm afraid that I must agree.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:18.76,0:16:19.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.67,0:16:23.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If they manage to stall Luffy and\Nthe sun rises, then we're screwed.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.04,0:16:25.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Him, me, and the cook.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:25.62,0:16:27.91,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll melt until we're nothing but ash.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.94,0:16:32.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Maybe we can't save ourselves,\Nbut if we can get Luvia's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.36,0:16:35.36,Default,,0,0,0,,shadow back he can lay\Nthis damn island to waste.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.44,0:16:38.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Looks like we got maybe\N30 minutes before sunrise.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.76,0:16:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,On the plus side that's\Nsome thick fog the sun's
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.56,0:16:44.52,Default,,0,0,0,,gonna have a hard time\Ngetting through that.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:44.60,0:16:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,So we're that close to dawn\Nwe should count our blessings.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.20,0:16:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got this fog.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.30,0:16:51.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't say it's much comfort though.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.54,0:16:55.08,Default,,0,0,0,,The reality of melting Everything's\Nstarting to sink in for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.16,0:16:55.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.07,0:16:58.10,Default,,0,0,0,,How long have I been standing there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.74,0:17:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,What the hell?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.48,0:17:07.13,Default,,0,0,0,,What is this, an earthquake?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.34,0:17:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What's going on?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.74,0:17:12.54,Default,,0,0,0,,The ship's not anchored, remember?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.62,0:17:15.80,Default,,0,0,0,,We're caught in another bad\Ncurrent like the last one!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.04,0:17:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, the sky! Look up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.80,0:17:21.64,Default,,0,0,0,,The sun's starting to come out!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.72,0:17:27.18,Default,,0,0,0,,And the fog. Why's the fog clearing\Nup? What's happening? Please tell me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.26,0:17:31.66,Default,,0,0,0,,i'm wrong but do you Think we could\Nhave left the florian triangle we
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.74,0:17:35.58,Default,,0,0,0,,have and it's all because oars was\Nscrewing Around with the helm earlier
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.66,0:17:40.16,Default,,0,0,0,,ah you're right it's all his fault\Nwhy the hell do you have to go and do
Dialogue: 0,0:17:42.72,0:17:43.66,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Sanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.24,0:17:46.30,Default,,0,0,0,,We've got some serious stuff on!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.74,0:17:48.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello, Mark is coming born again!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.64,0:17:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,We're on the moon and we've\Nbroken out of the fog!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.90,0:17:52.66,Default,,0,0,0,,And it's all horse cult!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.02,0:17:54.98,Default,,0,0,0,,That's Samurais!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:57.02,0:17:59.18,Default,,0,0,0,,So what? Stop streaming! Who cares?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.50,0:18:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,It's not the end of the world, you idiots.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:01.48,0:18:02.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We're pirates, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:02.92,0:18:06.57,Default,,0,0,0,,The whole ocean is our home, no\Nmatter where our ship ends up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.96,0:18:07.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:09.34,0:18:10.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Time to shut your mouths.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.02,0:18:13.62,Default,,0,0,0,,I have the unexpected pleasure\Nof an important guest,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:13.70,0:18:15.70,Default,,0,0,0,,and you're rudely interrupting it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.90,0:18:18.44,Default,,0,0,0,,So, Tyrant Kuma,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:18.74,0:18:20.88,Default,,0,0,0,,what can I do for the\Nonly member of the Seven
Dialogue: 0,0:18:20.96,0:18:24.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Warlords who chooses to obey\Nthe government like a dog?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.16,0:18:27.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The government considers you a valued\Nweapon in their arsenal of goons,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.76,0:18:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can't say I share their admiration.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:29.94,0:18:33.06,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't know what you're plotting,\Nbut I'm sure that I won't like it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.14,0:18:35.76,Default,,0,0,0,,If you were to take a vacation,\Nwhere would you want to go?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.84,0:18:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Come now, do I look like a fool?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.06,0:18:41.38,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm fully cognizant of the\Npowers you possess, all right.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:41.46,0:18:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Get to the point.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.44,0:18:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Did you come here to fight me or what?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.72,0:18:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak your business.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:46.18,0:18:48.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Why have you gone to the\Ntrouble of seeking me out?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.04,0:18:50.94,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here to deliver a report.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.42,0:18:52.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, let's hear it.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.86,0:18:57.48,Default,,0,0,0,,As you know, Crocodile has been removed\Nfrom his post as one of the Seven Warlords.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.56,0:18:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It's been decided who will replace him.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.62,0:19:00.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, yes!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.64,0:19:02.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Why didn't you say so?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.32,0:19:04.24,Default,,0,0,0,,And who have they chosen\Nas their successor?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:04.32,0:19:05.15,Default,,0,0,0,,sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.23,0:19:08.09,Default,,0,0,0,,There are hordes of pirates\Nthat would kill for the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.18,0:19:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,You might not have even heard of him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.26,0:19:11.74,Default,,0,0,0,,His name is Marshal D.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.92,0:19:14.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Teach, also commonly known\Nby the name of Blackbeard.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.96,0:19:15.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Blackbeard, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.10,0:19:17.92,Default,,0,0,0,,You're right. I don't know him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.84,0:19:21.74,Default,,0,0,0,,He was a member of Whitebeard's\Nfleet, 2nd Division.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.82,0:19:25.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He's only recently proven his\Nabilities that led to his appointment.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.58,0:19:28.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I suppose the news hasn't\Nreached these foggy waters yet,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.62,0:19:32.34,Default,,0,0,0,,but his powers have raised a great\Ndeal of commotion throughout the world.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.42,0:19:33.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Have they?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:33.33,0:19:36.24,Default,,0,0,0,,What was the original\Nbounty on his head? Zero.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:37.52,0:19:38.44,Default,,0,0,0,,How impressive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.52,0:19:39.64,Default,,0,0,0,,A total unknown.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:40.26,0:19:43.28,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm surprised that the government\Napproved him for the job.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.36,0:19:44.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes, yes, yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:44.42,0:19:48.64,Default,,0,0,0,,They're probably happy they managed to\Nfind someone to fill the spot so quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.72,0:19:53.54,Default,,0,0,0,,I expect that this is supposed to restore\Nthe balance of power or whatever, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.88,0:19:54.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.42,0:19:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,But if I were to place a bet, I\Nwould say it's the exact opposite.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:59.38,0:20:01.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Never mind that, though. Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:01.32,0:20:06.12,Default,,0,0,0,,There is an issue we must discuss, something\Nthe world government is anxious about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.20,0:20:08.94,Default,,0,0,0,,After the catastrophic\Nevents at Annie's lobby,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.02,0:20:12.72,Default,,0,0,0,,they're more concerned than ever about the\Nmovements of the Straw Hat pirate crew.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.80,0:20:16.60,Default,,0,0,0,,If they're following the log from\NWater 7 headed toward Fishman Island,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.68,0:20:20.10,Default,,0,0,0,,there is a high probability that\Nthey will find their way here.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.18,0:20:21.38,Default,,0,0,0,,If that's the case,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.48,0:20:25.95,Default,,0,0,0,,then I'm sure you can understand what\Nthe world government is worried about.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:26.36,0:20:28.02,Default,,0,0,0,,It's the balance of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.10,0:20:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,The government is concerned the Straw Hats
Dialogue: 0,0:20:30.68,0:20:32.82,Default,,0,0,0,,will take out another one\Nof the seven warlords.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.90,0:20:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,That would be most unfortunate.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:36.84,0:20:38.24,Default,,0,0,0,,You better be joking.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.32,0:20:40.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Do they think I'm not up to the job?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.76,0:20:44.20,Default,,0,0,0,,I've never been so insulted in my life.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.28,0:20:47.42,Default,,0,0,0,,They sent you here to protect me\Nagainst those pathetic nobodies!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:47.50,0:20:51.98,Default,,0,0,0,,If you think my assistance could benefit\Nyou, I'd be happy to help if you but asked.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.06,0:20:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Just who the hell do you\Nthink you're talking to?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:54.76,0:20:55.88,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.70,0:21:03.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Have you even seen their\Ncrew? A bunch of crackpots
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.90,0:21:06.30,Default,,0,0,0,,led by a rubber doll\Nand you honestly don't
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.38,0:21:08.96,Default,,0,0,0,,think that i can handle\Nthem no battle is 100
Dialogue: 0,0:21:09.04,0:21:12.82,Default,,0,0,0,,guaranteed do you know what\Ntranspired at Enies Lobby
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.90,0:21:15.84,Default,,0,0,0,,no one expected rob lucci\Nto lose and i'm sure
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.92,0:21:18.68,Default,,0,0,0,,he wasn't expecting it\Neither let me see if i get
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.76,0:21:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,this straight the\Ngovernment's so scared of the
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.88,0:21:22.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Straw Hats that they want\Nto pit two of the seven
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.06,0:21:26.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Warlords against them, huh?\NThey only send me here.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:26.96,0:21:29.68,Default,,0,0,0,,to warn you i was given\Nno specific orders to
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.76,0:21:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,offer you any assistance\Nthen i recommend you
Dialogue: 0,0:21:32.74,0:21:35.34,Default,,0,0,0,,stay out of my damn way\Nbuddy and if they want some
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.42,0:21:38.52,Default,,0,0,0,,kind of report you can\Ntell them this this straw
Dialogue: 0,0:21:38.60,0:21:40.24,Default,,0,0,0,,hat that's got the\Ngovernment swirling their
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.32,0:21:43.44,Default,,0,0,0,,bridges i've already dealt\Nwith him that means i
Dialogue: 0,0:21:43.52,0:21:46.40,Default,,0,0,0,,stole his shadow made it\Na part of my zombie army
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.06,0:21:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,The fog
Dialogue: 0,0:21:53.98,0:21:55.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Could it get any worse?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.58,0:21:56.86,Default,,0,0,0,,That fog was our last hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.94,0:21:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,There's nothing left to block the sun now!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:59.28,0:22:00.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Perfect.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:00.22,0:22:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The fog cleared up at\Nthe worst time possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:02.60,0:22:06.25,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm really not looking forward\Nto the sun melting my face off!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:10.02,0:22:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't know it was such\Na beautiful night out.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.32,0:22:15.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Moria!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:15.76,0:22:16.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It's Moria!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:17.46,0:22:19.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Moria? What? Where? What?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:19.82,0:22:21.11,Default,,0,0,0,,You're kidding, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:21.30,0:22:23.07,Default,,0,0,0,,Don is just around the corner.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:23.28,0:22:26.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you think this is the best time\Nfor you to be standing around?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:26.68,0:22:28.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Wait, how are you here?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:28.36,0:22:29.71,Default,,0,0,0,,What happened to Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:30.22,0:22:31.05,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:31.13,0:22:33.34,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm here, Master, but I can't see him.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:33.60,0:22:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Explain this, Usopp.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:35.02,0:22:36.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Just where the hell are you seeing Moria?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:36.66,0:22:37.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Look up, you idiots!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:37.64,0:22:39.56,Default,,0,0,0,,He's right there! The belly!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:39.70,0:22:40.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside Horst's belly!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:41.12,0:22:42.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Inside his belly!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:42.76,0:22:43.59,Default,,0,0,0,,He...
Dialogue: 0,0:22:43.67,0:22:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,he is!
Dialogue: 0,0:22:50.58,0:22:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,But where's Luffy?
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.32,0:22:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,Aw, don't tell me they\Ntricked him after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:54.16,0:22:55.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Or he's done for.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:55.76,0:22:59.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't you ever say Luffy's\Ndone for! Uh... sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:59.90,0:23:01.55,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't get what's going on.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:01.64,0:23:05.52,Default,,0,0,0,,How come I can't hear Master's\Nvoice, but I can't see him? Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.82,0:23:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Is that some kind of\Ncockpit or something? Crazy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.24,0:23:11.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Has there always been a cockpit in there?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:11.50,0:23:14.00,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, you pathetic\NStraw Hats, here I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:14.08,0:23:16.34,Default,,0,0,0,,You wanted a chance to\Nfight me, you've got one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.42,0:23:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,And if you prove yourself\Nskilled enough to defeat me,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:18.98,0:23:20.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll release all of the shadows.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:20.76,0:23:22.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Go ahead and come at me all at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:22.76,0:23:24.90,Default,,0,0,0,,But you'll have to take down Ours, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.98,0:23:28.80,Default,,0,0,0,,That's the only chance you've got\Nto pull me out of this cockpit.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:29.10,0:23:30.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, that's cheap.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:30.40,0:23:31.74,Default,,0,0,0,,You're not fighting fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.82,0:23:34.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The only way to defeat Ours\Nis to defeat Moria first.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:34.58,0:23:37.24,Default,,0,0,0,,But how the heck can we do that\Nwith him inside his stomach?
Dialogue: 0,0:23:37.32,0:23:39.28,Default,,0,0,0,,This narrows our target down to one.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.36,0:23:40.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Quit complaining.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:40.27,0:23:41.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Can't get cold feet now.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.90,0:23:45.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey you saw that little\Npinch didn't work earlier
Dialogue: 0,0:23:45.36,0:23:47.38,Default,,0,0,0,,so you're gonna have to\Nfind a mountain of salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:47.46,0:23:49.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Our only chance is to purify that monster.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:50.00,0:23:53.10,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll try to weaken as much\Nas we can until you get back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:53.18,0:23:54.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah okay I got it.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:54.26,0:23:55.09,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be right back.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:55.17,0:23:58.75,Default,,0,0,0,,If I remember correctly there's a kitchen\Nsomewhere at the front of the mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:58.84,0:24:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,They should have lots of salt there.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:00.48,0:24:01.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I should have figured as much.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:01.84,0:24:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,The first thing they're trying to\Ndo is get their hands on some salt.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:04.82,0:24:06.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh you hear that better?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:06.92,0:24:09.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Make sure long nose there doesn't\Nmake his way to the kitchen.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:09.48,0:24:12.02,Default,,0,0,0,,You might as well take out\Nthe entrance to the mansion.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:12.10,0:24:19.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Did
Dialogue: 0,0:24:20.32,0:24:26.12,Default,,0,0,0,,he get him?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.20,0:24:29.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:29.94,0:24:31.00,Default,,0,0,0,,With Merde inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:31.08,0:24:33.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Oars that idiot actually has a brain now.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:34.16,0:24:34.99,Default,,0,0,0,,Usopp!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:35.88,0:24:36.71,Default,,0,0,0,,Answer me!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:36.94,0:24:37.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Where are you?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:38.12,0:24:39.76,Default,,0,0,0,,He's perfectly fine!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:44.40,0:24:49.44,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought we might need a hefty quantity\Nof salt, so I rounded some up. Crook?
Dialogue: 0,0:24:49.90,0:24:51.58,Default,,0,0,0,,That was a close one.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:52.20,0:24:54.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Were you expecting someone\Nelse to rescue you?
